flowchart TD
    A([Start POS]) --> B[/Select product index and quantity/]
    B --> C{Quantity valid and within stock?}
    C -- No --> D[/Show error/]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Store array index plus quantity in cart]
    E --> F{Complete sale?}
    F -- No --> B
    F -- Yes --> G[Resolve each cart index against current products array]
    G --> H{Item exists and quantity within current stock?}
    H -- No --> I[/Show stock changed error/]
    I --> B
    H -- Yes --> J[Deduct stock from current indexed product]
    J --> K[Generate five-digit reference]
    K --> L[(Save aggregate date, reference, items, total)]
    L --> M[/Show completed reference/]
    M --> N([End])
